{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/96cb3dc010b61fbaa14b832aaaca3e4a.avif?t=1760860472\" width=467 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/902e31acda4cbfe114290085e702bf3a.avif?t=1760860472\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suncraft</strong> is a cozy village crafting adventure set in a charming pixel art world full of life, mystery, and warmth.<br>Take part in rebuilding a quiet land that is waiting to come alive again, a place where every crafted tool, planted seed, and helping hand makes a difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest villager, you will gather, build, and grow alongside friends who each have their own stories to tell.<br>The forests hide old memories, the mountains hold forgotten paths, and the fields slowly return to life as you work together to restore what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace with no timers and no pressure.<br>Settle into the calm rhythm of rebuilding, enjoy the small moments of progress, and watch the village evolve at the speed of your curiosity.<br>Suncraft is about care, creation, and the quiet joy of seeing a world take shape one peaceful task at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/0a220249b37d5a0adc301e283a82572e.webp?t=1760860472\" width=377 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources from forests, caves, and fields</strong>\u00a0- forage wood, ores, plants, and rare materials scattered across vibrant biomes. Every harvest fuels your crafting journey and helps the village grow stronger, one peaceful task at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/cf62a5cd5009244547c07b49f1c916d8.poster.avif?t=1760860472\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/cf62a5cd5009244547c07b49f1c916d8.webm?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/cf62a5cd5009244547c07b49f1c916d8.mp4?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and build tools, materials, and structures</strong>\u00a0- shape the world around you by refining resources into components, building new workstations, and restoring homes and landmarks that breathe life back into the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/8a599ceadf2a993b19daf4d50dcd25c8.poster.avif?t=1760860472\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/8a599ceadf2a993b19daf4d50dcd25c8.webm?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/8a599ceadf2a993b19daf4d50dcd25c8.mp4?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on heartfelt quests with villagers</strong>\u00a0- help friends repair bridges, rebuild dreams, and uncover the quiet stories that connect everyone. Each quest restores not just the village, but the bonds that make it whole again.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/9b444028283db4f3a2505ee448249336.poster.avif?t=1760860472\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/9b444028283db4f3a2505ee448249336.webm?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/9b444028283db4f3a2505ee448249336.mp4?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your abilities and tools</strong>\u00a0- enhance your gathering speed, crafting efficiency, movement, and other everyday comforts. Unlock quality-of-life upgrades that make every task smoother and more satisfying as your skills grow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/3b3f856e28d4fc6fa418d37196b420d7.poster.avif?t=1760860472\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/3b3f856e28d4fc6fa418d37196b420d7.webm?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/3b3f856e28d4fc6fa418d37196b420d7.mp4?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and uncover hidden lore</strong>\u00a0- engage in cozy conversations, discover secrets tucked behind waterfalls and ruins, and piece together the mysteries woven into the village\u2019s calm atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/0ffe3699fcde04f594dc1284345bdadc.poster.avif?t=1760860472\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/0ffe3699fcde04f594dc1284345bdadc.webm?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/0ffe3699fcde04f594dc1284345bdadc.mp4?t=1760860472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/f1ecd1df6d3025d7d4e7778cb9e6fb4b.webp?t=1760860472\" width=621 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet colorful villagers with their dreams, challenges, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/b9633b12ffcb64b13260b8bdf12ec814.avif?t=1760860472\" width=354 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eric</strong>, the steady workshop master, helps you with tools and repairs.<br><strong>Penny</strong> and <strong>Hank</strong> hope to rebuild the bridge that has long separated their lands.<br><strong>Kael</strong>, a wanderer drawn to volcanic lands, seeks answers.<br><strong>Niko</strong>, a young inventor, chases inventions that often outgrow their workbench.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow the village and your own strengths, you\u2019ll uncover hidden connections, small mysteries, and warmth returning to places that had grown quiet.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078110?t=1760860472","backgrou